WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.234 --> 00:00:02.434
-I'm very excited.

00:00:02.434 --> 00:00:05.267
You know I wrote --
I'm an author, right?

00:00:05.267 --> 00:00:06.400
-Yeah. Oh, yes.

00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:08.133
-So I've written "DADA."
-Yep.

00:00:08.133 --> 00:00:09.334
-And that was...
-Huge.

00:00:09.334 --> 00:00:11.200
-Well, yeah, it did well.
-Yeah. Yeah.

00:00:11.200 --> 00:00:13.634
-And I wanted my kid
to say "DADA" first.

00:00:13.634 --> 00:00:14.834
But I have a new book
coming out.

00:00:14.834 --> 00:00:16.033
-What?

00:00:16.033 --> 00:00:17.000
-...just in time
for Mother's Day

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:18.834
that is going to flip the lid.

00:00:18.834 --> 00:00:20.033
-You're gonna flip the script?

00:00:20.033 --> 00:00:21.467
-It's gonna --
It's just amazing.

00:00:21.467 --> 00:00:22.567
But I'm going to show it to you,
right?

00:00:22.567 --> 00:00:24.334
Ready for this one?
-Whoa.

00:00:24.334 --> 00:00:26.133
-[ Scoffs ] Dude,
this is my favorite one.

00:00:26.133 --> 00:00:28.000
[ Drum roll ]
Now, what is it --

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:29.667
It comes out in two weeks.
It's not even out.

00:00:29.667 --> 00:00:31.634
I just want to show it to you
for the first time.

00:00:31.634 --> 00:00:33.434
-Right.
Little -- wet your beak.

00:00:33.434 --> 00:00:35.033
Oh, snap!
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:35.033 --> 00:00:36.267
-"NANA."
-Oh!

00:00:36.267 --> 00:00:39.300
♪♪

00:00:39.300 --> 00:00:40.567
[ Cheers and applause continue ]

00:00:40.567 --> 00:00:42.033
-Come on.

00:00:42.033 --> 00:00:43.968
-It's a little...
-Yeah.

00:00:43.968 --> 00:00:46.200
-It's a little water-worky.
-Yeah.

00:00:46.200 --> 00:00:47.767
-It's pretty cool.
It's awesome.

00:00:47.767 --> 00:00:49.667
It's a love letter
to all the grandmas out there,

00:00:49.667 --> 00:00:52.367
the -- the gammies,
the abuelas, the --

00:00:52.367 --> 00:00:54.868
whatever
you call your grandma.

00:00:54.868 --> 00:00:58.167
"NANA" -- It's just --
And it's -- This --

00:00:58.167 --> 00:00:59.534
Honestly, this is the best one.

00:00:59.534 --> 00:01:01.400
This is -- It's just beyond.

00:01:01.400 --> 00:01:02.434
Look at the artwork.
-Wow.

00:01:02.434 --> 00:01:03.634
-It's just so cute.
[ Audience awws ]

00:01:03.634 --> 00:01:04.934
It's -- It's so cute.

00:01:04.934 --> 00:01:07.334
It's just awesome, yeah.
I'm very, very proud of it.

00:01:07.334 --> 00:01:09.234
Anyways, I'll talk more
about it, obviously, but...

00:01:09.234 --> 00:01:10.601
I'm -- I wanted to show it

00:01:10.601 --> 00:01:11.634
to you tonight.
[ Cheers and applause ]

